enter mb-6\" href=\"/contact-us\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">Email Our Team</span></a><div class=\"hidden lg:block pt-2\"><h3 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-3\">Follow Us</h3><div class=\"flex gap-3\"><a aria-label=\"Follow on Facebook\" class=\"h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#1877F2] hover:text-white hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-200\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TopTenUAEofficial\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-facebook w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z\"></path></svg></a><a aria-label=\"Follow on X (Twitter)\" class=\"h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 text-slate-100 rounded-lg hover:bg-black hover:text-white hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-200\" href=\"https://x.com/top10_uae\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-twitter w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\"></path></svg></a><a aria-label=\"Follow on Instagram\" class=\"h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 text-slate-