/toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://toptenuae.com/search?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#homepage\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/\",\"name\":\"TopTenUAE - The Best of the UAE, Ranked\",\"description\":\"Discover trending products, expert reviews, and free UAE tools including VAT and gratuity calculators.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"UAE Product Reviews and Comparisons\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-AE\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com/images/brand/og-default.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com#howto\",\"name\":\"Gmail’s Gemini 3 Update (2026): 5 New AI Features to Save You Hours\",\"description\":\"Google has officially shifted Gmail into the \\\"Gemini Era\\\" with the new Gemini 3 update. From instant thread summaries to context-aware drafting, here is how these 5 new features will save UAE professionals hours of lost productivity in 2026.\",\"image\":[\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/c0e44be40c5ca4dcd518fb75bf59eef3161c58b9-1920x1080.webp\"],\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"estimatedCost\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"AED\",\"value\":\"0\"},\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Read Full Guide\",\"text\":\"Google has officially shifted Gmail into the \\\"Gemini Era\\\" with the new Gemini 3 update. From instant thread summaries to context-aware drafting, here is how these 5 new features will save UAE professionals hours of lost productivity in 2026.\",\"url\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"}],\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://toptenuae.com/#webpage\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the new Gmail Gemini 3 update free to use?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Basic features like Smart Reply and simple drafting are available to free personal accounts. However, the advanced Gemini 3 capabilities—such as \\\"Q&A with Inbox,\\\" deeply contextual summaries, and \\\"Help Me Write\\\" with Drive integration—require a Google One AI Premium subscription or a Google Workspace business plan.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I activate Gemini AI features in my Gmail settings?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To enable Gemini, go to Settings (Gear Icon) > General and ensure the box for \\\"Smart features and personalization\\\" is checked. Once enabled, you will see the Gemini \\\"Sparkle\\\" icon (✨) appear in the top-right corner of your web inbox or near the reply button on the mobile app.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is my email data used to train Gemini AI?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For Google Workspace Enterprise and Business users, Google has stated that your email data is not used to train their public AI models, ensuring confidentiality for UAE businesses. Personal users have control over their data usage through the \\\"Smart features and personalization\\\" settings menu.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use Gemini features on the Gmail app for iPhone and Android?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The 2026 update prioritizes mobile productivity. Features like AI Overviews (instant thread summaries) and Smart Replies are native to the Gmail app on both iOS and Android, allowing you to manage long email threads while on the move.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why can't I see the Gemini sparkle icon in my inbox?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"If you don't see the icon, first verify you have an active Google One AI Premium plan. If you are a business user, your Workspace administrator may need to enable \\\"Early Access Apps\\\" in the admin console. Also, ensure your \\\"Smart features\\\" are turned on in the General settings tab.\"}}]}]}0:{\"buildId\":\"0l0HEHUer7u9z1jFStNEN\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],\"$L3\"],[\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],\"loading\":null,\"isPartial\":false}\n3:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"w-full mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Guides\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/how-to-guides\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gmail’s Gemini 3 Update (2026): 5 New AI Features to Save You Hours\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://toptenuae.com/how-to-guides/gmail-gemini-ai-features-2026\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center text-sm space-x-2 overflow-hidden flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center shrink-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"text-gray-500 hover:text-[#4b0082] transition-colors flex items-center p-1 rounded hover:bg-black/5\",\"title\":\"Back to Homepage\",\"aria-label\":\"Go to homepage\",\"children\":[[\"